'''Poison Barb''' (Japanese: '''どくバリ''' ''Poison Barb'') is a {{TCGP|Pokémon Tool}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Celestial Guardians}} expansion.

==Card text==
{{TCGTrainerText
|class=Tool
|rule=Pocket Tool
|effect=If the Pokémon this card is attached to is your Active Pokémon and is damaged by an attack from your opponent's Pokémon, the Attacking Pokémon is now {{TCG|Poisoned}}.
}}

==Trivia==
This card's effect is identical to that of the {{TCG|Poison Barb}} card in the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game]].

===Origin===
* The [[Poison Barb]] is an item in the [[Pokémon games]] that boosts the power of {{type|Poison}} moves when held.
* This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sun & Moon|Poison Barb|124}} from the {{TCG|Sun & Moon}} expansion.

